WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:06.588
Daisy bent down.

2
00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:10.312
A mouse was trembling near her feet.

3
00:00:10.313 --> 00:00:14.281
"Your cat ran past," he said.

4
00:00:14.282 --> 00:00:17.512
"I barely had time to hide!

5
00:00:17.513 --> 00:00:22.712
She climbed that maple tree just ahead."

6
00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:25.515
"This mouse says Dumpling is in that tree."

7
00:00:25.516 --> 00:00:28.943
Daisy pointed to the maple.

8
00:00:28.944 --> 00:00:32.924
