11
00:00:47.891 --> 00:00:51.083
"I'm here!" a voice called.

12
00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:55.321
"But I'm stuck!"

13
00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.608
Kaleem gasped.

14
00:00:59.609 --> 00:01:01.871
"It's Dumpling!"

15
00:01:01.872 --> 00:01:07.056
"You mean you heard her too?" Daisy asked in surprise.

16
00:01:07.057 --> 00:01:11.398
Kaleem nodded. "Dumpling meows really loudly."

17
00:01:11.399 --> 00:01:14.372
"She wasn't meowing," Daisy said.

18
00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:16.981
"She was talking

19
